{
  "$comment": "Perfil endurecido para a estação de laudos de OCT. Copie para ~/.claude/settings.json (ou .claude/settings.json da pasta de trabalho). Ajuste USUARIO no caminho dos hooks.",
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "default",
    "allow": [
      "Bash(python3 ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 $HOME/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 /Users/*/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/laudo_pdf.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 $HOME/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/laudo_pdf.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 /Users/*/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/laudo_pdf.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/dividir_guia.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 $HOME/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/dividir_guia.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 /Users/*/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/dividir_guia.py *)",
      "Bash(mkdir -p ~/Laudos_OCT/*)",
      "Bash(ls *)",
      "Bash(cat ~/Laudos_OCT/*)",
      "Bash(cat ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/references/*)",
      "Bash(sed -n * ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/references/*)",
      "Bash(sleep *)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(python3 ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py type *)",
      "Bash(python3 $HOME/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py type *)",
      "Bash(python3 /Users/*/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py type *)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm *)",
      "Bash(rmdir *)",
      "Bash(mv *)",
      "Bash(sudo *)",
      "Bash(chmod *)",
      "Bash(chown *)",
      "Bash(killall *)",
      "Bash(osascript *)",
      "Bash(cliclick *)",
      "Bash(screencapture *)",
      "Bash(curl *)",
      "Bash(wget *)",
      "Bash(nc *)",
      "Bash(ssh *)",
      "Bash(scp *)",
      "Bash(git push *)",
      "Bash(defaults write *)",
      "Bash(launchctl *)",
      "Bash(open *)",
      "Bash(security *)",
      "Bash(pbcopy *)",
      "Bash(pbpaste *)",
      "WebFetch",
      "WebSearch",
      "Read(~/Library/**)",
      "Read(~/.ssh/**)",
      "Read(~/.aws/**)",
      "Read(~/Documents/**)",
      "Read(~/Desktop/**)",
      "Read(~/Downloads/**)",
      "Read(~/Pictures/**)",
      "Read(**/.env)",
      "Read(**/.env.*)",
      "Write(~/Library/**)",
      "Write(~/.claude/settings.json)",
      "Write(~/.claude/skills/**)",
      "Write(~/.zshrc)",
      "Write(~/.bashrc)",
      "Write(~/.zprofile)"
    ],
    "$comment": "allow lista as três formas de caminho de cada script porque o casamento é textual. ask cobre AS MESMAS TRÊS formas da digitação — com duas, a terceira caía no allow e digitava sem confirmação. deny vence allow."
  },
  "sandbox": {
    "$comment": "Seatbelt do macOS, imposto pelo kernel — o modelo não negocia com isso. excludedCommands tira do sandbox SÓ o script de mãos, que precisa falar com o WindowServer para clicar. TESTE NO DIA 1: se o clique parar de funcionar com sandbox ligado, é o Seatbelt barrando o evento de mouse — o excludedCommands é a saída. Se funcionar dentro do sandbox, remova o excludedCommands e fica melhor. As variantes ~/ e $HOME/ existem porque a regra casa o texto do comando: se o agente escrever o caminho de outra forma, a regra não pega e ele para para pedir permissão.",
    "enabled": true,
    "allowUnsandboxedCommands": false,
    "excludedCommands": [
      "python3 ~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py",
      "python3 $HOME/.claude/skills/laudos-oct/scripts/hands.py"
    ],
    "filesystem": {
      "allowWrite": [
        "~/Laudos_OCT",
        "~/.laudos_oct"
      ],
      "denyRead": [
        "~/"
      ],
      "allowRead": [
        "~/Laudos_OCT",
        "~/Laudos_OCT/guia",
        "~/.laudos_oct",
        "~/.claude/skills/laudos-oct"
      ]
    },
    "network": {
      "allowedDomains": []
    }
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/guardiao-laudos.py",
            "statusMessage": "Guardião: conferindo o comando..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
